      "id": "aib-s2-types-of-ai-c1",
      "heading": "Narrow AI (ANI): one task, done well",
      "explanation_md": "The deck splits AI into three types. The first is **Artificial Narrow Intelligence (ANI)**, also called **Weak AI**.\n\n**Key trait:** it is **task-specific** and **common**. It is built for one job and that is all it does.\n\n**Examples from the slide:** **Netflix** recommendations, **Siri**, **Alexa** and **Face ID**. Each is clever at one thing only.",
      "example_ids": [
        "aib-ex-ani-examples"
      ],
